menu "Phonlet Wake"

    config ESP_WAKE_S3_BATCH
        int "S3 engine: frames per pass over the weights"
        range 1 8
        default 4
        help
            The ESP32-S3 engine reads the model's weights from PSRAM once per
            batch of 32 ms frames, so a larger batch uses less CPU. Each extra
            frame delays every detection by 32 ms: delay = (batch - 1) x 32 ms.
            Detections are otherwise the same. See the component README for
            the CPU measured at each setting.

endmenu
